<title>JAPAN: Fuji Robin Ind - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fuji Robin Ind - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.91		vs	    6.06</p>
<p> Operating	  284    mln	  vs	  306    mln</p>
<p> Current	    254    mln	  vs	  229    mln</p>
<p> Net		   91    mln	  vs	   75    mln</p>
<p> EPS		    7.09 yen	  vs	    5.83 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     13 million	  vs	  13 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Fuji Robin Industries Ltd is a medium-sized manufacturer of agricultural machines and small engines.</p>
